# Fetched reference copies (tmp/algorithms/refs). The markdown there is ours and
# is tracked; the fetched documents are not - 30 MB of binaries, and the trade
# press articles are copyrighted text this repo should not redistribute.
# Re-fetch with tmp/algorithms/refs/fetch.sh
tmp/algorithms/refs/patents/*.pdf
tmp/algorithms/refs/papers/*.pdf
tmp/algorithms/refs/articles/*.html
tmp/algorithms/refs/articles/*.txt
